All changes are clean. Here's a summary of this round across 7 files:

**`ExtensionLoader.java`**
- `new LinkedList<>()` → `new ArrayList<>()` for two accumulator lists (already had `ArrayList` imported)
- `includedPackages != null && includedPackages.length > 0` → `ArrayUtils.isNotEmpty(includedPackages)`

**`ConfigUtils.java`**
- `new LinkedList<>()` → `new ArrayList<>()` for both `classLoadersToLoad` lists; removed unused `LinkedList` import

**`ReflectUtils.java`**
- `new LinkedList<>(asList(...))` → `new ArrayList<>(asList(...))` ; removed unused `LinkedList` import
- `parameterTypes != null && parameterTypes.length > 0` → `!isEmpty(parameterTypes)` (using the static import already present)

**`AnnotationUtils.java`**
- Three `new LinkedList<>()` → `new ArrayList<>()`; swapped `LinkedList` import for `ArrayList`

**`FrameworkModel.java`**
- Five `.size() == 0` / `.size() > 0` comparisons → `.isEmpty()` / `!isEmpty()`

**`URL.java`**
- `reserveParams == null || reserveParams.length == 0` → `ArrayUtils.isEmpty(reserveParams)`
- `reserveParamPrefixes != null && reserveParamPrefixes.length != 0` → `ArrayUtils.isNotEmpty(reserveParamPrefixes)`

**`MethodConfig.java`**
- Added `ArrayUtils`, `CollectionUtils`, `Arrays`, `Collectors` imports; removed `ArrayList`
- Two raw `array != null && array.length != 0` → `ArrayUtils.isNotEmpty(array)`
- `this.getArguments() != null && this.getArguments().size() > 0` → `CollectionUtils.isNotEmpty(...)`
- Two indexed `for` loops that constructed lists element-by-element → stream + method-reference (`ArgumentConfig::new`, `MethodConfig::new`)

